Global - your choice, your advantage</b>\n                                    </h3>\n                                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                                        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Architecto beatae\n                                        error facere itaque, minima officiis quia repudiandae saepe suscipit. Atque\n                                        facere illum odio porro quibusdam quod rerum sapiente vero voluptate. Lorem\n                                        ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Ab alias aliquam amet\n                                        commodi dolorem earum eos.\n                                    </p>\n                                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                                        <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont\n                                                 mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Company\n                                        </a>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <p class=\"mbr-amount mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-amount\" mbr-if=\"showAmount\">\n                                        <b>1000+</b>\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\">\n                                        <b>Global more</b>\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        <