          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "globalm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cards\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\" selected>5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#124AD6\" selected>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\" parallax>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>Ventajas que marcan la diferencia</b></h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">- Calidad y experiencia<br>- Fácil logística</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\">\n                <div class=\"row cards\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 card\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Reducción significativa de tiempos de obra</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>01 - </b>Se estima que la instalación de 50 m lineales puede realizarse hasta 10 días antes que con una fundición en sitio, optimizando recursos y generando ahorro directo.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 1\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Alta calidad del concreto</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>\n                            02 - </b>Cada unidad se produce con concreto mezclado en planta, bajo estrictos controles computarizados, garantizando una excelente resistencia, compactación y durabilidad.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 2\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Acople perfecto y sellado hermético</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>\n                            03 - </b>El sistema de campana y espigo asegura una conexión precisa entre módulos, reduciendo la migración de agua y finos del suelo. Este sistema se complementa con SikaLockstop, un sello que crea una unión hermética, sin necesidad de presión interna ni herramientas especializadas, facilitando la instalación sin residuos ni olores molestos.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 3\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Cumplimiento normativo</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>\n                            04 - </b>Nuestros box culvert se fabrican según las normas Colombianas NTC 5558 (bandas sellantes para juntas) y NTC 5672 (secciones rectangulares prefabricadas para alcantarillado), brindando respaldo técnico y confiabilidad para proyectos de infraestructura pública y privada.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 4\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Logística eficiente</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>05 - </b>La naturaleza modular del sistema permite una fácil movilización, menor necesidad de mano de obra y una obra mucho más limpia y ordenada.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 5\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Building maintenance services</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit aut consectetur.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 6\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Installation</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit aut consectetur.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 7\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Condition monitoring</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit aut consectetur.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uHl8gTkAFG",
          "_anchor": "contenido-ventajas",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
