            ".mbr-section-title, .title-wrapper, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article02 operationm5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Active Color 1\" value=\"#7F89E9\" name=\"active_1\" condition=\"showButtons\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Active Color 2\" value=\"#FB8FC9\" name=\"active_2\" condition=\"showButtons\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"card\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-2.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f4f4f6\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-2.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 card\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/postes-cerca-415x476.png\" alt=\"Postes para cerca\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 card\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"content-wrap\">\n                        <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .title-wrapper, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                            Postes para cerca</h2>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">Nuestros postes de cerca se fabrican en línea larga en sistema pretensado, superando en calidad y resistencia a los postes de concreto armado. Cuentan con homologación para ser instalados en obras civiles y tenemos una capacidad de <b>producción diaria</b> de hasta <b>900 metros lineales.</b><br><br></p>\n                        <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .title-wrapper, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                            Especificaciones</h2>\n                                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">Sección: 10 cm x 10 cm (+/-1 cm)<br>Longitud: De acuerdo a la solicitada por el cliente.<br>Ranuras para instalación de alambre de acuerdo con la distancia requerida por el cliente. <br>Alambre de refuerzo de 5.25 mm y fy 18 ton/cm²<br></p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                View more\n                            </a>\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Contacts us\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_isUserblock": true,
