          "_name": "features3",
          "_sourceTheme": "globalm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features3\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border\" name=\"border\" value=\"#e5e5e5\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"BG Icon\" name=\"iconBg\" value=\"#124AD6\" condition=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color Icon\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"showButtons\">\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cards\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n            <option value=\"9\">9</option>\n            <option value=\"10\" selected>10</option>\n            <option value=\"11\">11</option>\n            <option value=\"12\">12</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icon\" name=\"showIcon\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"icon\" value=\"#124AD6\" selected condition=\"showIcon\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"title-container\">\n                    <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                        <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>10 ventajas por las cuales usar placas alveolares en su proyecto</b></h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Start\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row cards justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 card\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-globe mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\"></span>\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-iconfont\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                    <b>Global solutions</b>\n                </h5>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><b>01 - </b>Mejor aislamiento térmico y acuático que los sistemas de piso tradicionales.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 1\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-help mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\"></span>\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-iconfont\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                    <b>Global questions</b>\n                </h5>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><b>\n                    02 - </b>Aligeran el peso de la estructura.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 2\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-up mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\"></span>\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-iconfont\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                    <b>Level up</b>\n                </h5>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><b>\n                    03 - </b>Mayor eficiencia en el procedimiento constructivo.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 3\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-users mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\"></span>\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-iconfont\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                    <b>Global person</b>\n                </h5>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><b>04 - </b>La superficie inferior presenta un acabado liso y con menos juntas.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 4\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-cash mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\"></span>\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-iconfont\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                    <b>Global cash</b>\n                </h5>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><b>05 - </b>La superficie superior presenta rugosidad para la unión de la capa de concreto.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 5\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-protect mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\"></span>\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-iconfont\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                    <b>Global security</b>\n                </h5>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><b>\n                    06 - </b>Se pueden utilizar sin capa de concreto adicional.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 6\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-protect mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\"></span>\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-iconfont\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                    <b>Global security</b>\n                </h5>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><b>07 - </b>Ahorro en obra de formaletas, equipos, mano de obra de estructura, eliminación de DESPERDICIOS.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 7\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-protect mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\"></span>\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-iconfont\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                    <b>Global security</b>\n                </h5>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><b>08 - </b>Permite montar hasta 600 m<sup>2</sup> al día, con una sola cuadrilla de trabajo.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 8\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-protect mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\"></span>\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-iconfont\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                    <b>Global security</b>\n                </h5>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><b>09 -&nbsp;</b>Reducción de tiempos de obra hasta 3 meses para proyectos entre 3.000 m<sup>2</sup> y 6.000 m<sup>2</sup></p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 9\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-protect mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\"></span>\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-iconfont\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                    <b>Global security</b>\n                </h5>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><b>10 - </b>Reducción de costos de hasta un 28% por m<sup>2</sup>, al compararlo con el sistema de placa aligerada fundida en sitio.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 10\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-protect mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\"></span>\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-iconfont\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                    <b>Global security</b>\n                </h5>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">\n                    Se pueden ulizar sin capa de concreto adicional.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 11\">\n                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-protect mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\"></span>\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-iconfont\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                    <b>Global security</b>\n                </h5>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">\n                    Se pueden ulizar sin capa de concreto adicional.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
