          },
          "_name": "features6",
          "_sourceTheme": "globalm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features6\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cards\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card\" name=\"card\" value=\"#051744\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Active\" name=\"activeCard\" value=\"#124AD6\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border\" name=\"border\" value=\"#124AD6\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Active Border\" name=\"activeBorder\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Date\" name=\"showCardDate\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"BG Icon\" name=\"iconBg\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color Icon\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#124AD6\" condition=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background3-1.jpg\" parallax>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background3-1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>In the news</b>\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Architecto corporis dicta dolore eaque\n                        ex illo iure, labore quas rem soluta? Ab beatae est fugit in itaque nisi, nobis omnis voluptate.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row cards\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 card\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap_1\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-date mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-date\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCardDate\">\n                            Tecnología para Colombia y el mundo</p>\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Nuestra planta de producción y acopio</b></h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"card-overlay\"></div>\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/traviesas-planta-acopio.webp\" alt=\"Planta de traviesas - Acopio\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap_2\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-text\">Contamos con un sistema de producción en línea larga y central de mezclas automatizada. Obteniendo una capacidad instalada de 480 traviesas por turno, la cual puede ser ampliada, llegando a producir volúmenes de hasta 1,300 traviesas por día.<br><br>Contamos con un ramal directo sobre la vía férrea, lo que nos permite ofrecer a nuestros clientes diferentes opciones de transporte por carretera y vía férrea.<br></p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"transporte.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Ver transporte</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"plantas-de-produccion.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Ver plantas</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 1\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap_1\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-date mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-date\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCardDate\">Normas AREMA</p>\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>¡Calidad y experiencia!</b></h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"card-overlay\"></div>\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/traviesas-control-calidad.webp\" alt=\"Traviesas control de calidad\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap_2\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-text\">Contamos con un laboratorio propio para realizar los ensayos establecidos por la Norma AREMA a nuestras traviesas.<br><br>Fabricadas bajo la tecnología de <b>Rocla Concrete Tie Inc</b> y las especificaciones de las normas AREMA.<br><br><br><br></p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"assets/files/catalogo-traviesas-de-concreto.pdf\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Ver brochure</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 2\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap_1\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-date mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-date\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCardDate\">\n                            March 14, 2023\n                        </p>\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Global every time</b>\n                        </h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap_2\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-text\">\n                            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Distinctio doloribus eaque\n                            eligendi, hic incidunt iste itaque quae repellendus repudiandae rerum saepe vel veritatis.\n                        </p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Company\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 3\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap_1\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-date mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-date\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCardDate\">\n                            Jan 24, 2021\n                        </p>\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Our products was first</b></h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap_2\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-text\">\n                            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Distinctio doloribus eaque\n                            eligendi, hic incidunt iste itaque quae repellendus repudiandae rerum saepe vel veritatis.\n                        </p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Company\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 4\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap_1\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-date mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-date, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCardDate\">\n                            Jan 03, 2023\n                        </p>\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Description company</b></h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap_2\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-text\">\n                            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Distinctio doloribus eaque\n                            eligendi, hic incidunt iste itaque quae repellendus repudiandae rerum saepe vel veritatis.\n                        </p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Company\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 5\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap_1\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-date mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-date\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCardDate\">\n                            March 14, 2023\n                        </p>\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Global every time</b></h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap_2\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-text\">\n                            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Distinctio doloribus eaque\n                            eligendi, hic incidunt iste itaque quae repellendus repudiandae rerum saepe vel veritatis.\n                        </p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Company\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
